ed with direct evidence of an online expansion from 1 GiB to 2.25 GiB, continuous mounting, and preserved content. The mandatory node-restart protocol is also complete: it includes a healthy pre-restart state, restart acknowledgement, a changed boot ID corroborated by lifecycle observations, and recovered service, mount, LV, filesystem, loop device, and payload state.","limitations":["The final lifecycle snapshot reports one failed LVM pvscan unit, although direct post-restart checks show the required volume and activation service healthy.","Package-manager consistency was unavailable both before and after execution, so the health of the mixed RHEL/CentOS package installation cannot be independently confirmed."]}
